ivided", "That the City paid more than under a bid contract"]}, "wt": [0.06, 0.12, 0.39, 0.73, 1.23, 1.39, 2.0, 2.2, 2.38, 2.72, 3.04, 3.19]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[1]", "notEstablished[2]", "established[13]"], "text": "The Purchaser says repeat buying is hard to foresee.", "t0": 117.86, "t1": 120.12, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That any single job or invoice was divided", "That the City paid more than under a bid contract"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.02, 0.43, 0.64, 0.97, 1.3, 1.43, 1.63, 1.77]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[1]"], "text": "What would settle it? The invoices behind each order, and any approval to buy tires this way.", "t0": 120.24, "t1": 124.63, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "The invoices behind each purchase order named here"}, {"who": "", "what": "The Purchaser’s file on the tire contract, and any approval to use Prop Q in between"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.21, 0.48, 0.72, 0.89, 1.41, 1.74, 1.97, 2.43, 2.67, 2.82, 3.28, 3.4, 3.57, 3.93, 4.08]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status", "notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The audit covered only the Human Rights Commission. No authority has examined the fleet purchases.", "t0": 124.75, "t1": 128.76, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.37, 0.67, 0.95, 1.05, 1.3, 1.5, 2.09, 2.23, 2.57, 2.71, 3.08, 3.17, 3.39]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 128.88, "t1": 130.85, "shot": "b23", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.34, 0.47, 0.54, 1.13, 1.28, 1.42]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The question", "lead1": "The audited department", "lead2": "Lead 1 · beyond one department", "lead3": "Lead 2 · the tires", "lead4": "Lead 3 · the limit doubles", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "terminal", "hook": "document"}